The companion reimplements the client side of the protocol for a browser
and a local bridge. It does not modify the upstream Kotlin sources.
A read-only snapshot of that commit is stored in ../_reference/reverse-of-power.
The file ../_reference/COMMIT records how the snapshot was taken.

This project is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by
Sony Interactive Entertainment or Wish Studios. It contains none of
their game assets, photo masks, sounds, or trademarks as creative works.
Names of the games are used only to state compatibility.

The bridge opens a PlayLink UDP session when a browser joins. The web page
draws the controller from console events over the bridge API. The Kotlin
tree is untouched.
